// Repo-wide: the point is to show whether a
// finding is one shared defect or many.

// ...scoring those findings out of all 97
// recipes would report them as rare when they
// are near universal among the recipes where
// they are measurable at all -- a denominator
// that flatters the result.

  FINDING                 OF MEASURABLE   READ AS
  script-missing          94/97      97%  one template-wide defect
  documented-not-built     4/4      100%  one template-wide defect
  built-not-documented     4/4      100%  one template-wide defect
